  "shortlist_protocol": "On the same low-margin quarter, request only the four highest baseline classes per passage. Scale just the four available LL scores by their within-shortlist SD and the base full-row SD. Use the fixed 10% mix conditional on the shortlist and preserve its total probability. Counts are source-conditioned sequences, not measured elapsed time.",
  "late_protocol": "Keep the original token-only GLM selection and entropy weight. Once the complete GLM pass finishes, add just the ATLAS adjustment (four shortlisted prefixes, fixed 10%) to the saved post-GLM logits before the original sibling and typography pass. Allows an optional stage with an exact fallback to token-only predictions."
